sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant POS  as POS Client
  participant GW   as Apollo Gateway
  participant ID   as Identity Service
  participant CART as Cart Service
  participant CACHE as Inventory Cache (Redis)
  participant SAP  as SAP ECC

  Note over POS,SAP: Trigger — Store Associate scans customer loyalty QR code at the in-store POS terminal

  POS->>GW:   POST /graphql — cartLookupByQR(qrToken, storeId) [+30ms p95 POS→AWS MPLS]
  Note right of POS: Authorization: Bearer {associate-JWT}

  GW->>ID:    GET /identity/qr/{token} [+5ms p95 intra-AZ]
  Note over ID: PostgreSQL — resolve QR token → customer_id [+10ms p95]
  ID-->>GW:   {customer_id, name, loyaltyTier, consentFlags} [+5ms p95]

  GW->>CART:  GET /cart/active?customerId={id} [+5ms p95 intra-AZ]
  Note over CART: PostgreSQL — load active cart line items [+15ms p95]
  CART-->>GW: {cart_id, items:[{sku, qty, unitPrice}, …]} [+5ms p95]

  GW->>CACHE: MGET inventory:{storeId}:{sku} × N line items [+3ms p95 Redis batch]

  alt Happy path — all N SKUs found in Inventory Cache
    CACHE-->>GW: [{sku, count, label, syncTs}, …] — all cache hits [+3ms p95]
    GW-->>POS:  {customer, cart, items with availability: dataSource=CACHE} [+30ms p95 GW→POS]
    Note over POS,CACHE: ✅ Happy path ≈ 111ms p95 — within 200ms in-store SLO

  else Cache miss — SKU-X returns null in MGET response
    CACHE-->>GW: […, null for SKU-X, …] [+3ms p95]

    Note over GW,SAP: ⚠ Inline SAP ECC fallback — this step dominates latency
    GW->>SAP:   InventoryRead RFC/BAPI (storeId=X, materialNumber=SKU-X) [+400ms p95]
    SAP-->>GW:  {unrestricted_stock, reserved_qty, last_movement_ts} [included in RFC roundtrip]

    GW-->>POS:  {customer, cart, SKU-X: availability.dataSource=SAP_FALLBACK} [+30ms p95]
    Note over POS,SAP: ⚠ Cache-miss path ≈ 511ms p95 — within 700ms degraded SLO
  end

  Note over POS,SAP: Bottleneck — SAP ECC inline RFC ~400ms p95 dominates when Inventory Cache misses. Primary mitigation: keep cache warm via Kafka stock events from SAP Inventory Adapter (async, out of band). Secondary mitigation: degrade to availability=UNKNOWN on cache miss — skip SAP call entirely and show 'Check with floor staff'.
